# E2E first

A feature is not done when a unit test is green.

Done means the real path holds:

SOURCE OF TRUTH → DOMAIN CONTRACT → BACKEND → API → FRONTEND PROJECTION → OPERATOR INTERACTION → RUNTIME → TESTS

PASS requires runtime evidence. Do not claim success from mocks, hardcoded UI states, or screenshots alone.

Browser or API interaction must exercise the real backend path when the feature has one.
